# --- Not part of this repository -------------------------------------------
# Clyde's earlier GB power-market data project. Kept locally as a sibling
# folder because grid-aware-scheduler imports two of its API clients at
# runtime (see grid-aware-scheduler/HANDOFF.md, "External dependency"), but it
# is separate work with its own lifecycle and is deliberately not tracked here.
National-Grid-Tool/

# editor configuration, not shared project config
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# env files (never commit real keys)
.env
.env.local

# --- data ------------------------------------------------------------------
# cached market data pulled from live APIs — re-fetchable, don't track
**/data/cache/
**/data/calibration/profiles.json
# local facility-discovery endpoint declarations (docs/discovery.md) —
# operator-specific addresses, never shared
**/data/discovery.json
# the operator's declared site energy profile (docs/site-profile.md) — real
# meter IDs, contracts and connection identities. The example in docs/ is the
# shareable one; this is not.
**/data/site-profile.json
*.sqlite
*.db
*.parquet

# notebook scratch state
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- private strategy notes ------------------------------------------------
# Market sizing, competitive positioning and target-operator assessments.
# These say so in their own headers and must never reach the public repo: the
# honesty rules in grid-aware-scheduler/HANDOFF.md keep commercial claims out
# of docs/, and one `git add .` would otherwise publish them wholesale.
/meta-fit-assessment.md
/pilot-pitch-narrative.md
/regulatory-market-landscape.md
/megawatt-constrained-25.md

# --- os --------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store

# generated dashboard output + screenshots — rebuilt by `python -m app.dashboard`
**/app/build/

# local application process state and logs
grid-aware-scheduler/.runtime/

# python build artefacts from `pip install .`
grid-aware-scheduler/build/
grid-aware-scheduler/dist/
*.egg-info/

# Renewables.ninja response cache (rate limit is 50/hour — do not refetch)
grid-aware-scheduler/data/cache/ninja/
